  "releaseNotes": "2.1.0 — LTS Multi-Targeting & Tool Enhancements. Targets .NET 8.0 (LTS), .NET 10.0 (LTS), and .NET Standard 2.0 across all 14 packages; enabled Scrubkit.Pdf and Scrubkit.Images out of the box in Scrubkit.Tool CLI; updated test suites and docs. Full changelog: https://github.com/jjopensoftworks-blip/Scrubkit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
